  "wikitext": "Each vaulted asset has a 50% chance of being kept during reincorporation. You can install [[quantum stabilization]] to increase the chance to 75%.\n\nWhen you have not built a [[space station]], it shows \"''You need to build a space station in <code>$$[[orbit]]</code> to access your quantum vault.''\" when you do <code>$$vault</code>.\n\nYou can use <code>$$vaultall</code> and <code>$$vaultremove</code> to add and remove assets on quantum vault.",
